# fizzbuzz_body.ds - One iteration of the FizzBuzz loop.
#
# Per iteration:
#   1. Increment counter (handles ones/tens carry).
#   2. Decrement C_MOD3; if it hits 0, print "Fizz", refill mod3 to 3, clear neither flag.
#   3. Decrement C_MOD5; if it hits 0, print "Buzz", refill mod5 to 5, clear neither flag.
#   4. If neither flag is still set, print the number using c5,c3.
#   5. Print newline.
#   6. Reset neither flag.
#
# Pre: ptr at c0; counter cells initialized (use fizzbuzz_init.ds).
# Post: ptr at c0; one line of output emitted.

# === SECTION 1: Increment counter (ones and tens with carry logic) ===
GEAR 3 RIGHT GAS RIGHT BRAKE 
PARK BRAKE GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 LEFT DRIVE 
GEAR 3 RIGHT GAS LEFT 
PARK BRAKE GEAR 2 LEFT GAS GEAR 3 RIGHT PARK BRAKE DRIVE LEFT DRIVE 

# === SECTION 2: Decrement C_MOD3, handle Fizz ===
GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 3 RIGHT 
PARK GEAR 4 LEFT PARK BRAKE DRIVE RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE 
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 3 RIGHT BRAKE GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 3 LEFT 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 3 RIGHT PARK BRAKE RIGHT GAS LEFT DRIVE 
GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS LEFT 
PARK BRAKE LEFT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT PARK BRAKE DRIVE LEFT DRIVE 

# === SECTION 3: Decrement C_MOD5, handle Buzz ===
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 4 LEFT 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT 
PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE 
GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 3 GAS GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 3 LEFT 
RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 2 GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT HONK 
RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 2 GAS RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT HONK 
RIGHT GEAR 4 GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 4 GAS RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT GAS HONK HONK 
RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE BRAKE RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT BRAKE 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 4 RIGHT 
PARK BRAKE DRIVE GEAR 4 LEFT DRIVE 

# === SECTION 4: Decrement C_MOD3 again for next iteration ===
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT BRAKE 
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT 
PARK BRAKE RIGHT GAS LEFT DRIVE 
GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS LEFT 
PARK BRAKE LEFT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT PARK BRAKE DRIVE LEFT DRIVE 

# === SECTION 5: Decrement C_MOD5 again for next iteration ===
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 2 LEFT 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 3 RIGHT 
PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE 
GEAR 2 LEFT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT 
RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GAS RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT HONK 
RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT GAS HONK 
GEAR 5 GAS HONK HONK 
RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 5 BRAKE GEAR 5 BRAKE BRAKE RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT BRAKE 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 4 RIGHT 
PARK BRAKE DRIVE LEFT DRIVE 

# === SECTION 6: Number output (if neither flag set) ===
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 3 LEFT 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 4 RIGHT 
PARK BRAKE GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS RIGHT GAS GEAR 3 LEFT DRIVE 
GEAR 3 RIGHT PARK BRAKE GEAR 3 LEFT GAS GEAR 3 RIGHT DRIVE 
LEFT PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE 
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT 
GEAR 5 RIGHT PARK BRAKE RIGHT GAS RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 LEFT DRIVE 
GEAR 2 RIGHT PARK BRAKE GEAR 2 LEFT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT DRIVE 
LEFT PARK PARK BRAKE DRIVE 
GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT 
GEAR 5 RIGHT PARK BRAKE GEAR 5 LEFT GAS RIGHT GAS GEAR 4 RIGHT DRIVE 
GEAR 4 LEFT PARK BRAKE GEAR 4 RIGHT GAS GEAR 4 LEFT DRIVE 
LEFT RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 3 GAS RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT HONK 
PARK BRAKE DRIVE 
GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT DRIVE 

# === SECTION 7: Print tens digit ===
GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT GEAR 3 RIGHT 
PARK BRAKE GEAR 3 LEFT GAS RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 RIGHT DRIVE 
GEAR 2 LEFT PARK BRAKE GEAR 2 RIGHT GAS GEAR 2 LEFT DRIVE 
LEFT RIGHT GEAR 5 GAS GAS 
PARK LEFT GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 3 GAS RIGHT BRAKE DRIVE LEFT HONK 
PARK BRAKE DRIVE 

# === SECTION 8: Print newline ===
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT RIGHT DRIVE 
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT LEFT 
GEAR 5 GAS GEAR 5 GAS HONK 

# === SECTION 9: Reset neither flag and return to c0 ===
PARK BRAKE DRIVE 
GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 5 RIGHT GEAR 4 RIGHT 
PARK BRAKE DRIVE GAS 
GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 5 LEFT GEAR 4 LEFT
